nt gas in Earth’s dry atmosphere?","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Carbon dioxide","is_correct":false},{"label":"B","text":"Argon","is_correct":false},{"label":"C","text":"Hydrogen","is_correct":false},{"label":"D","text":"Oxygen","is_correct":true}],"explanation":"Oxygen makes up about 21% of dry air, after nitrogen at about 78%.","source":"File 2 General, printed question 236","editorial_status":null,"provenance":null,"references":[],"id":"15a95992-addb-4b85-8491-fcf4372d549c","subject_id":"a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"}},{"entry":410,"status":"INSERT","question_id":"4f6b3b03-a47f-41ab-a913-6b713fdcc62e","source":{"entry":410,"stem":"What is 5% of 50,000?","options":[{"label":"A","text":"2,500","is_correct":true},{"label":"B","text":"250","is_correct":false},{"label":"C","text":"5,000","is_correct":false},{"label":"D","text":"1,250","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"0.05 × 50,000 = 2,500.","source":"File 2 General, printed question 237","editorial_status":null,"provenance":null,"references":[]},"record":{"entry":410,"stem":"What is 5% of 50,000?","options":[{"label":"A","text":"2,500","is_correct":true},{"label":"B","text":"250","is_correct":false},{"label":"C","text":"5,000","is_correct":false},{"label":"D","text":"1,250","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"0.05 × 50,000 = 2,500.","source":"File 2 General, printed question 237","editorial_status":null,"provenance":null,"references":[],"id":"4f6b3b03-a47f-41ab-a913-6b713fdcc62e","subject_id":"36b65a9a-2171-424e-99e2-e41e08d259cc"}},{"entry":411,"status":"INSERT","question_id":"ac25f812-0b78-43ca-a836-8487e33fa880","source":{"entry":411,"stem":"Which word is an antonym of humanity when it means kindness?","options":[{"label":"A","text":"Compassion","is_correct":false},{"label":"B","text":"Cruelty","is_correct":true},{"label":"C","text":"Mercy","is_correct":false},{"label":"D","text":"Benevolence","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"Cruelty is the opposite of humane kindness; aridity refers to dryness.","s